RGB30: mark v2 DTB model string so ES/Info identifies HW rev

Rename the v2 DTB's model property from "Powkiddy RGB30" to
"Powkiddy RGB30 v2" so it appears distinct in
/sys/firmware/devicetree/base/model and in knulli-info's
ES "Model:" line. Once u-boot picks the right DTB per HW rev,
this is a free visual indicator of which board a user is on -
useful for tester bug reports.

Signed-off-by: James Pharaoh <james@pharaoh.uk>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-rgb30-v2-linux.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-rgb30-v2-linux.dts
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
 #include "rk3568-linux.dtsi"
 
 / {
-	model = "Powkiddy RGB30";
+	model = "Powkiddy RGB30 v2";
 	compatible = "rockchip,rk3566-evb2-lp4x-v11", "rockchip,rk3566";
 
 	adc_keys: adc-keys {
